{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23500","headline":"求分司东都寄牛相公十韵 · 白居易","name":"求分司东都寄牛相公十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽忽心如梦，星星鬓似丝。\n纵贫长有酒，虽老未抛诗。\n俭薄身都惯，疎顽性颇宜。\n饭麤飱亦饱，被暖起常迟。\n万里归何得，三年伴是谁。\n华亭鹤不去，天竺石相随。\n王尹贳将马，田家卖与池。\n开门闲坐日，遶水独行时。\n嬾慢交游许，衰羸相府知。\n官寮幸无事，可惜不分司。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}